{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794585852247,"sessionID":"ses_e2a5adb61ffe5JLlq3JICE94gJ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d5a6f7cc001838XgaESQNiWob","sessionID":"ses_e2a5adb61ffe5JLlq3JICE94gJ","messageID":"msg_1d5a6e3c7001noViPgn8P3HpHx","type":"tool","id":"call_60ce67d4ce2a425b88d23f7a","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v2.7.0.0.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v2.7.0.0.md, lines 1-32\n1: ---\n2: title: \"sk-doc v2.7.0.0, one REFERENCES name and wider inventory checks\"\n3: description: \"v2.7.0.0 names the closing REFERENCES AND RELATED RESOURCES section in the skill contract, lets a code-folder README list its files under WHAT IS IN THE PACKAGE or STRUCTURE or in a structure tree, and adds a test that keeps the SKILL.md size table in step with the packager.\"\n4: trigger_phrases:\n5:   - \"sk-doc v2.7.0.0\"\n6:   - \"sk-doc 2.7.0.0\"\n7:   - \"code folder inventory check\"\n8: importance_tier: \"normal\"\n9: contextType: \"general\"\n10: version: 2.7.0.0\n11: ---\n12: \n13: # v2.7.0.0, One REFERENCES Name and Wider Inventory Checks\n14: \n15: The skill contract and the sk-create-skill templates now agree on how a SKILL.md closes, and a flat code folder can list its files the way most READMEs already do.\n16: \n17: > Spec folder: `specs/sk-doc/066-skill-readability-refinement/014-sk-create-skill-refinements/003-templates-and-fleet` (Level 3)\n18: \n19: &nbsp;\n20: \n21: ## What's New at a Glance\n22: \n23: - **One closing section name.** `shared/assets/skill-contract.json` lists `REFERENCES AND RELATED RESOURCES` as the last entry of the skill section order, matching the SKILL.md template and scaffold, and its recommended list drops RELATED RESOURCES, which that section carries.\n24: - **Wider inventory headings.** `validate_document.py` accepts a WHAT IS IN THE PACKAGE or STRUCTURE heading as a flat folder's file inventory, and counts a file named in a fenced structure tree inside that section. Both names count only as a Markdown heading, and a list that leaves a file out still fails `code_folder_flat_inventory`.\n25: - **Size table drift test.** `scripts/tests/test_skill_size_table.py` fails when the SKILL.md template's Size Limits table and the `package_skill.py` constants disagree.\n26: - **A heading for an orienting table.** The human-voice reference index opens its OVERVIEW with `### When to Use` above its load table.\n27: \n28: &nbsp;\n29: \n30: ## Upgrade\n31: \n32: No migration required.","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v2.7.0.0.md, lines 1-32\n1: ---\n2: title: \"sk-doc v2.7.0.0, one REFERENCES name and wider inventory checks\"\n3: description: \"v2.7.0.0 names the closing REFERENCES AND RELATED RESOURCES section in the skill contract, lets a code-folder README list its files under WHAT IS IN THE PACKAGE or STRUCTURE or in a structure tree, and adds a test that keeps the SKILL.md size table in step with the packager.\"\n4: trigger_phrases:\n5:   - \"sk-doc v2.7.0.0\"\n6:   - \"sk-doc 2.7.0.0\"\n7:   - \"code folder inventory check\"\n8: importance_tier: \"normal\"\n9: contextType: \"general\"\n10: version: 2.7.0.0\n11: ---\n12: \n13: # v2.7.0.0, One REFERENCES Name and Wider Inventory Checks\n14: \n15: The skill contract and the sk-create-skill templates now agree on how a SKILL.md closes, and a flat code folder can list its files the way most READMEs already do.\n16: \n17: > Spec folder: `specs/sk-doc/066-skill-readability-refinement/014-sk-create-skill-refinements/003-templates-and-fleet` (Level 3)\n18: \n19: &nbsp;\n20: \n21: ## What's New at a Glance\n22: \n23: - **One closing section name.** `shared/assets/skill-contract.json` lists `REFERENCES AND RELATED RESOURCES` as the last entry of the skill section order, matching the SKILL.md template and scaffold, and its recommended list drops RELATED RESOURCES, which that section carries.\n24: - **Wider inventory headings.** `validate_document.py` accepts a WHAT IS IN THE PACKAGE or STRUCTURE heading as a flat folder's file inventory, and counts a file named in a fenced structure tree inside that section. Both names count only as a Markdown heading, and a list that leaves a file out still fails `code_folder_flat_inventory`.\n25: - **Size table drift test.** `scripts/tests/test_skill_size_table.py` fails when the SKILL.md template's Size Limits table and the `package_skill.py` constants disagree.\n26: - **A heading for an orienting table.** The human-voice reference index opens its OVERVIEW with `### When to Use` above its load table.\n27: \n28: &nbsp;\n29: \n30: ## Upgrade\n31: \n32: No migration required."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v2.7.0.0.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794585851852,"end":1794585852247}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794585852269,"sessionID":"ses_e2a5adb61ffe5JLlq3JICE94gJ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d5a6f5d4001IfDBkoFkRx09He","sessionID":"ses_e2a5adb61ffe5JLlq3JICE94gJ","messageID":"msg_1d5a6e3c7001noViPgn8P3HpHx","type":"tool","id":"call_4c07ef943a4c422c92af469f","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && wc -l .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/*.md | sort -n | tail -8"},"output":"      40 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v2.4.0.0.md\n      49 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v2.0.0.0.md\n      71 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v1.6.0.0.md\n      78 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v1.8.0.0.md\n      78 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v2.1.0.0.md\n      94 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v1.8.1.0.md\n     101 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v1.5.0.0.md\n    2549 total\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"      40 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v2.4.0.0.md\n      49 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v2.0.0.0.md\n      71 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v1.6.0.0.md\n      78 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v1.8.0.0.md\n      78 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v2.1.0.0.md\n      94 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v1.8.1.0.md\n     101 .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/v1.5.0.0.md\n    2549 total\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && wc -l .skilled/skills/sk-doc/changelog/*.md | sort -n | tail -8\"}"},"time":{"start":1794585851348,"end":1794585852269}}}}
