{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794585894880,"sessionID":"ses_e2a5adb61ffe5JLlq3JICE94gJ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d5a79a26001vM2AyURwWRhX4P","sessionID":"ses_e2a5adb61ffe5JLlq3JICE94gJ","messageID":"msg_1d5a72922001EFwwsuz04qkW2D","type":"tool","id":"call_29f9c61c5dd8402cb95ce650","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && node --test .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/sync-runtime-mirrors.test.mjs 2>&1 | tail -12"},"output":"✔ derives each DSH adapter link from the hook library and flags a real file or a missing link (7.348291ms)\n✔ counts what each runtime shows and flags a collapsed folder (0.397875ms)\n✔ flags a command folder whose skill.md hides its siblings on Claude Code (0.295458ms)\n✔ flags a skill file in any capitalisation (0.319042ms)\nℹ tests 9\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 9\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 331.395125\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"✔ derives each DSH adapter link from the hook library and flags a real file or a missing link (7.348291ms)\n✔ counts what each runtime shows and flags a collapsed folder (0.397875ms)\n✔ flags a command folder whose skill.md hides its siblings on Claude Code (0.295458ms)\n✔ flags a skill file in any capitalisation (0.319042ms)\nℹ tests 9\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 9\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 331.395125\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && node --test .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/sync-runtime-mirrors.test.mjs 2>&1 | tail -12\"}"},"time":{"start":1794585893414,"end":1794585894880}}}}
